_build
dist
dist-newstyle
*~
*.hi
*.o
*.bak

# Local Claude Code agent definitions
.claude/

# PyRun/ is the tracked, project-independent exercise harness (engine +
# config descriptor + tests/ + docs). Only its generated run output is
# ignored — everything lands under PyRun/out/ (per-area reports, raw
# captures, summary.*, generated graph fixtures), plus pycache and any
# locally-dropped agda-deps path record.
PyRun/out/
PyRun/.agda-deps-bin
PyRun/**/__pycache__/

# Kept local, not version-controlled: BattleTest/ is the archived prior run
# (reports + graph fixtures + the hand-distilled Impr.md), and the generated
# optimization HTML (OptSite/). The tracked CI harness is
# .github/workflows/ci.yml.
BattleTest/
OptSite/

# Note: .agda-explore/deps.json IS tracked here as a query/test fixture
# (it is not this project's own generated graph — this repo links no Agda).

# Runtime query telemetry written by the agda-explore daemon (not reproducible).
.agda-explore/query-log.jsonl
